{"chunk_id": "a1b62e500dbd", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "参股企业", "date_hint": "", "text": "激光雷达的本质是一种以激光为辐射源的主动探测器，通过测距和测角来实现探测目的。激光雷达LiDAR（LightDetectionandRaging）是激光探测及测距系统的简称，另外也称LADAR（LaserDetectionandRanging）。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "a1b62e500dbd", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "94fc0b8bf386", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "参股企业", "date_hint": "", "text": "激光雷达的优点包括解析度高，测距精度高；抗有源干扰能力强；探测性能好；不受光线影响；测速范围大。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "94fc0b8bf386", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "f0994000ce0c", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "参股企业", "date_hint": "", "text": "", "image_only": true, "classification": {"label": "strict_knowledge", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "image_only", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "strict_knowledge", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "acd319596204", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "参股企业", "date_hint": "", "text": "激光雷达硬件可分为扫描模块、发射模块、接收模块及控制模块\n1、扫描模块主要作用为通过扫描器的机械运动控制光的传播方向，实现对特定区域的扫描，扫描形式的选择主要影响探测范围广度及激光雷达整体的耐用及稳定性；", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "acd319596204", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "457c8ebb9aee", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "参股企业", "date_hint": "", "text": "2、发射模块负责激光源的发射，不同光源及发射形式的选择影响射出光的能量大小，继而影响光源可达到的探测范围深度；", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "457c8ebb9aee", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "97b1450a1edb", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "参股企业", "date_hint": "", "text": "3、接收模块则负责接收返回光，不同探测器的选择影响对返回光子的探测灵敏度，继而影响激光雷达整体可探测的距离及范围；", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "97b1450a1edb", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "c1a4942ba7eb", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "参股企业", "date_hint": "", "text": "4、控制模块主要通过算法处理生成最终的点云模型，以供后续自动驾驶决策算法参考生成后续行进策略", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "c1a4942ba7eb", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
